Modifications by AR Dynamics Inc., including but not limited to:
  * The privacy architecture in cybrreach/privacy.py: the central contacts
    store (hub.openoutreach.app) is disabled by default — its client calls
    are replaced with no-ops, its hostname is refused at name resolution,
    telemetry environment flags are set off, and mailbox TLS is forced to
    verify certificates. Opt-in re-enablement: CYBRREACH_ENABLE_HUB=1.
  * Opt-out guards re-hooked to the 0.1.88 sender layout so a clear opt-out
    is honoured before the model answers, with CI coverage for refactors.
  * The CybrReach distribution name, CLI, packaging, and documentation.

